ETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\"><font size=\"5\">2010-2학기 생활관 선발 완료 및 입사 안내</font></span>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">생활관을 지원해 주셔서 감사합니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">2010-2학기 생활관 입사자 선발이 완료되었습니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">추후 환불자가 발생될 경우 이미 접수한 선착순 순서에 의해 개별 연락하여 등록할 수 있도록 하겠습니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">￭ 2학기 입사기간 : 2010. 8. 30(월) 14:00부터</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">￭ 입사 선발자 제출서류(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">미제출자는 퇴사조치 함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;생활관 입사하는 전 관생은 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;①</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">결핵</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"> 및 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">B형 간염</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"> 2가지만</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">검진한 검사결과서(소견서) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▸ 간염검사에서 항원이 양성일 경우 병원(내과)에서 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">활동성 또는 비활동성 여부에 대해 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">추가 검사한 결과서를 제출하여야 함.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">비활동성 보균자는 입</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">사할 수 있음</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▸ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">1학기에 제출한 건강진단서는 재활용 가능</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">(항체 : 양성, 항원 : 음성일 경우만)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font size=\"3\">* 매학기 결핵은 검사하시기 바람</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;② 주민등록등본 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">③ 입사할 때 자치회에서 배부하는 생활관 입사 설문지(호실 비품 수령 List)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">※ 열쇠 보관금을 환불받을 본인의 계좌번호 필히 명기<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’맑은 고딕’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">￭ 등록절차</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"41\" height=\"52\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">호실</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">확인</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" val